# AI Prompt Edit Rule

When editing files in `prompts/` (especially `ai_system_prompt.txt`):

- **Write and modify all instruction text in English only.** Do not use Korean for rules, descriptions, or command explanations.
- Korean may appear only inside example user queries (Q:) and example responses (A:) where they are sample data.
- Keep placeholders `{task_headers}`, `{task_full_data}`, `{items_full_data}` as-is; they are filled at runtime.
